      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/washam"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Flaming Gorge National Recreation Area spans over 207,000 acres across Wyoming and Utah near the community of Washam.",
